          "category": "agent-computer-use",
          "basis": "browser-evidence",
          "rationale": "The earlier steps select PagerDuty. Sentry documents its browser integration, service/severity rules and synthetic error generation; PagerDuty exposes incident acknowledgment, resolution and grouping inspection. Warning-threshold alerts may require manual resolution, and advanced grouping requires the relevant plan; test those recovery limits before relying on the routing.",
