    {
      "id": "n6",
      "kind": "step",
      "title": "Create post-mortem template",
      "guidance": "Draft a template for impact, detection, a linked timeline, contributing conditions, recovery and follow-up work. Leave room for uncertainty and competing explanations. Try it with a past or fictional incident: can the reader tell what happened, why decisions were made and which improvement would address the failure? Remove sections that add no useful evidence, and identify the writer, reviewer and appropriate audience for the finished document.",
